HLD/LFS/Pages/CLS-Trainee-Hematologist.aspx"><span class="additional-background ms-navedit-flyoutArrow"><span class="menu-item-text">Clinical Hematologist Scientist Trainee License</span></span></a></li><li class="dynamic"><a class="dynamic menu-item ms-core-listMenu-item ms-displayInline ms-navedit-linkNode" href="/Programs/OSPHLD/LFS/Pages/CLS-Trainee-Histocompatibility.aspx"><span class="additional-background ms-navedit-flyoutArrow"><span class="menu-item-text">Clinical Histocompatibility Scientist Trainee License</span></span></a></li><li class="dynamic"><a class="dynamic menu-item ms-core-listMenu-item ms-displayInline ms-navedit-linkNode" href="/Programs/OSPHLD/LFS/Pages/CLS-Trainee-Immunohematologist.aspx"><span class="additional-background ms-navedit-flyoutArrow"><span class="menu-item-text">Clinical Immunohematologist Scientist Trainee License</span></span></a></li><li class="dynamic"><a class="dynamic menu-item ms-core-listMenu-item ms-displayInline ms-navedit-linkNode" href="/Programs/OSPHLD/LFS/Pages/CLS-Trainee-Microbiologist.aspx"><span class="additional-background ms-navedit-flyoutArrow"><span class="menu-item-text">Clinical Microbiologist Scientist Trainee License</span></span></a></li><li class="dynamic"><a class="dynamic menu-item ms-core-listMenu-item ms-displayInline ms-navedit-linkNode" href="/Programs/OSPHLD/LFS/Pages/CLS-Trainee-Toxicologist.aspx"><span class="additional-background ms-navedit-flyoutArrow"><span class="menu-item-text">Clinical Toxicologist Scientist Trainee License</span></span></a></li><li class="dynamic"><a class="dynamic menu-item ms-core-listMenu-item ms-displayInline ms-navedit-linkNode" title="The purpose of this site is to assist you to confirm the validity of licenses and certificates with this searchable list online.  Appearance on the list as active verifies the current validity of any license or certificate." href="/Programs/OSPHLD/LFS/Pages/Verify.aspx"><span class="additional-background ms-navedit-flyoutArrow"><span class="menu-item-text">License Verification</span></span></a></li><li class="dynamic"><a class="dynamic menu-item ms-core-listMenu-item ms-displayInline ms-navedit-linkNode" title="Landing page for clinical laboratory professional licensing requirements and information. California state law requires that licensed clinical laboratories in California employ testing personnel who are licensed by the State." href="/Programs/OSPHLD/LFS/Pages/ClinicalLaboratoryPersonnel.aspx"><span class="additional-background ms-navedit-flyoutArrow"><span class="menu-item-text">Clinical Laboratory Professional Licensing</span></span></a></li><li class="dynamic"><a class="dynamic menu-item ms-core-listMenu-item ms-displayInline ms-navedit-linkNode" title="California law requires license and certificate holders to renew California licenses and certificates every two years. Renewal of national certification is optional, and can only be done by contacting the national certifying organization directly." href="/Programs/OSPHLD/LFS/Pages/Personnel-Renewal.aspx"><span class="additional-background ms-navedit-flyoutArrow"><span class="menu-item-text">Renewal of Clinical Laboratory Personnel Licenses &amp; Certificates</span></span></a></li><li class="dynamic"><a class="dynamic menu-item ms-core-listMenu-item ms-displayInline ms-navedit-linkNode" title="Clinical laboratory personnel are required by regulations to notify LFS in writing of a change of address within 30 days after the change has occurred." href="/Programs/OSPHLD/LFS/Pages/Personnel-Changes.aspx"><span class="additional-background ms-navedit-flyoutArrow"><span class="menu-item-text">Changing Key Demographic Information</span></span></a></li><li class="dynamic"><a class="dynamic menu-item ms-core-listMenu-item ms-displayInline ms-navedit-linkNode" title="There are three levels of phlebotomy certification, each with a different scope of practice." href="/Programs/OSPHLD/LFS/Pages/Phlebotomist.aspx"><span class="additional-background ms-navedit-flyoutArrow"><span class="menu-item-text">Phlebotomy Certificate</span></span></a></li>
						</ul></li>
					</ul></li>
				</ul></li><li class="static selected"><a class="static selected menu-item ms-core-listMenu-item ms-displayInline ms-core-listMenu-selected ms-navedit-linkNode" href="/"><span class="additional-background ms-navedit-flyoutArrow"><span class="menu-item-text">Recent</span><span class="ms-hidden">Currently selected</span></span></a></li>
			</ul>
		</div>
